{"seq":1,"slug":"worker-pool","title":"Worker 池：复用线程与负载均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/patterns/worker-pool","wordCount":1202,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"worker-池-复用线程与负载均衡\">Worker 池：复用线程与负载均衡</h1><p>每来一个任务就 <code>new Worker()</code>、算完就 <code>terminate()</code>，在 demo 里没问题，在生产里却是个反模式。创建一根 Worker 要付出线程启动、脚本下载解析、模块图加载的固定开销——往往十几到几十毫秒；如果任务本身只算几毫秒，创建成本就把并行的收益吃光了。Worker 池（Worker Pool）的思路和数据库连接池如出一辙：预先开好一批线程常驻，用任务队列把活儿派给空闲的那根，算完不销毁、留着接下一个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个 Worker 池由三部分组成：一组预创建的常驻 Worker、一个待处理任务队列、一个调度器负责把队头任务分给空闲 Worker 并在其完成后回收复用。每个任务带一个唯一 <code>id</code>，用来把异步返回的结果配对到当初的请求（通常是一个 Promise 的 resolve）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[提交任务 exec data] --&gt; B{有空闲 Worker?}&#10;  B --&gt;|有| C[派给空闲 Worker&lt;br/&gt;标记 busy]&#10;  B --&gt;|没有| D[任务入队等待]&#10;  C --&gt; E[Worker 计算]&#10;  E --&gt; F[onmessage 返回结果&lt;br/&gt;按 id 匹配 resolve]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Worker 标记 idle]&#10;  G --&gt; H{队列非空?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| C&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[Worker 待命]\">flowchart TD\n  A[提交任务 exec data] --&gt; B{有空闲 Worker?}\n  B --&gt;|有| C[派给空闲 Worker&lt;br/&gt;标记 busy]\n  B --&gt;|没有| D[任务入队等待]\n  C --&gt; E[Worker 计算]\n  E --&gt; F[onmessage 返回结果&lt;br/&gt;按 id 匹配 resolve]\n  F --&gt; G[Worker 标记 idle]\n  G --&gt; H{队列非空?}\n  H --&gt;|是| C\n  H --&gt;|否| I[Worker 待命]</pre><p>池的本质是「固定线程数 × 无限任务」的解耦。它建立在前面讲过的原语之上：用 <a href=\"../communication/postmessage-structured-clone\">postMessage 与结构化克隆</a> 里的 <code>{id, cmd, payload}</code> 信封传任务，用 <code>id</code> 配对响应；复用的是 <a href=\"../foundations/worker-types\">Worker 类型对比</a> 里定位为「计算主力」的 Dedicated Worker，而它值得复用的根因正是 <a href=\"../foundations/worker-model\">隔离与通信模型</a> 里讲的 <code>terminate()</code> 硬终止与创建开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"池大小-该开几根线程\">池大小：该开几根线程</h2><p>池里开几根 Worker 不是越多越好。线程数超过硬件并行度后，多出来的线程只是在抢同样的 CPU 核心、徒增上下文切换与内存。一个稳健的默认值是用 <code>navigator.hardwareConcurrency</code>（逻辑核心数）作上限：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>pool</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>任务并发需求</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">navigator.hardwareConcurrency</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{pool}} = \\min(\\text{任务并发需求},\\ \\texttt{navigator.hardwareConcurrency})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pool</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">任务并发需求</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">navigator.hardwareConcurrency</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>池大小策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>hardwareConcurrency</code></td>\n<td>CPU 密集计算</td>\n<td>几乎占满，留意主线程也要核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hardwareConcurrency - 1</code></td>\n<td>需保留主线程算力</td>\n<td>略保守，更稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定小值（2-4）</td>\n<td>任务偶发、内存敏感</td>\n<td>高并发时排队变长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>仅为卸载、无需并行</td>\n<td>退化为单 Worker</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 <code>hardwareConcurrency</code> 在部分浏览器出于指纹防护会返回一个夹住的值（如最高 8），且它是逻辑核非物理核，所以它只是个起点，最终池大小应结合任务画像和实测来定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个最小池实现\">一个最小池实现</h2><p>下面是一个能跑的池骨架，省略了错误重试以突出主干：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"class WorkerPool {&#10;  constructor(url, size = navigator.hardwareConcurrency) {&#10;    this.idle = Array.from({ length: size }, () =&gt; new Worker(url, { type: &#39;module&#39; }));&#10;    this.queue = []; // 待处理任务&#10;    this.pending = new Map(); // id -&gt; {resolve, reject}&#10;    this.seq = 0;&#10;    for (const w of this.idle) {&#10;      w.onmessage = (e) =&gt; this.#onDone(w, e.data);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  exec(payload, transfer = []) {&#10;    return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {&#10;      const id = ++this.seq;&#10;      this.pending.set(id, { resolve, reject });&#10;      this.queue.push({ id, payload, transfer });&#10;      this.#pump();&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;  #pump() {&#10;    while (this.idle.length &amp;&amp; this.queue.length) {&#10;      const w = this.idle.pop();&#10;      const task = this.queue.shift();&#10;      w.__task = task.id;&#10;      w.postMessage({ id: task.id, payload: task.payload }, task.transfer);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  #onDone(w, { id, result }) {&#10;    this.pending.get(id)?.resolve(result);&#10;    this.pending.delete(id);&#10;    this.idle.push(w);&#10;    this.#pump();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class WorkerPool {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  constructor(url, size = navigator.hardwareConcurrency) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.idle = Array.from({ length: size }, () => new Worker(url, { type: 'module' }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.queue = []; // 待处理任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.pending = new Map(); // id -> {resolve, reject}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.seq = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (const w of this.idle) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      w.onmessage = (e) => this.#onDone(w, e.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  exec(payload, transfer = []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const id = ++this.seq;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      this.pending.set(id, { resolve, reject });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      this.queue.push({ id, payload, transfer });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      this.#pump();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  #pump() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while (this.idle.length &#x26;&#x26; this.queue.length) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const w = this.idle.pop();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const task = this.queue.shift();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      w.__task = task.id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      w.postMessage({ id: task.id, payload: task.payload }, task.transfer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  #onDone(w, { id, result }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.pending.get(id)?.resolve(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.pending.delete(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.idle.push(w);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.#pump();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>#pump</code> 是调度核心：只要既有空闲线程又有排队任务，就不断配对。配合 <a href=\"../communication/transferable-objects\">可转移对象</a>，<code>exec(payload, [buffer])</code> 能把大缓冲零拷贝地交给被选中的 Worker——但要记住转移后源端 buffer 就空了，分发多份时每份须是独立 buffer。</p>\n<h2 id=\"背压-队列积压时怎么办\">背压：队列积压时怎么办</h2><p>池解决了线程复用，但没解决「任务来得比算得快」。如果上游无节制地 <code>exec</code>，队列会无限膨胀，内存涨、延迟也涨——这就是背压（backpressure）问题。常见对策有三种：限制队列最大长度，超出就拒绝或丢弃旧任务；给 <code>exec</code> 加并发上限，让调用方 <code>await</code> 形成天然节流；或合并同类任务（debounce），高频请求只保留最新一个。</p>\n<p>设任务到达速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、池的总处理速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>pool</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = N_{\\text{pool}} \\cdot \\mu_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pool</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单 Worker 速率），只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &lt; \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 时队列才稳定；一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &gt; \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，队列长度无界增长，必须靠背压把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 压下来。这套排队论直觉对所有异步队列都成立，与 <a href=\"../../frontend-data-fetching/\">前端数据请求(42)</a> 里请求并发控制的思路同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"池的生命周期与清理\">池的生命周期与清理</h2><p>池本身也要管生命周期。页面卸载或不再需要时，应 <code>terminate()</code> 掉池里所有 Worker，否则线程会一直占着内存。在框架里，这通常绑定到组件卸载——具体到 React 的 <code>useEffect</code> 清理、Vue 的 <code>onUnmounted</code>，由 <a href=\"../practice/worker-framework-integration\">框架集成</a> 展开。一个健壮的池还应处理 Worker 崩溃：监听 <code>onerror</code>，把那根挂掉的 Worker 替换成新建的，并让它正在跑的任务 reject 或重排——这部分错误恢复与可观测衔接到 <a href=\"../practice/worker-debugging\">调试与可观测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>反复 new/terminate 的固定开销会吃掉短任务的并行收益，Worker 池通过复用常驻线程消除它。</li>\n<li>池 = 常驻 Worker 组 + 任务队列 + 调度器；用唯一 <code>id</code> 把异步结果配对回请求 Promise。</li>\n<li>池大小以 <code>navigator.hardwareConcurrency</code> 为起点，CPU 密集可减一保留主线程，最终靠实测定。</li>\n<li>任务到达快于处理（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &gt; \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>）会导致队列无界增长，必须用队列上限、并发节流或合并做背压。</li>\n<li>池要管生命周期：卸载时 terminate 全部线程，并处理 Worker 崩溃的替换与任务重排。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"comlink-rpc\">RPC 与 Comlink</a> — 给池套上优雅的调用门面；<a href=\"parallel-compute\">并行计算与分片</a> — 跑在池上的具体算法；<a href=\"../communication/transferable-objects\">可转移对象</a> — 给 Worker 零拷贝喂数据。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../frontend-data-fetching/\">前端数据请求(42)</a> — 并发控制与背压的同源思路；<a href=\"../../performance-optimization/runtime-performance/javascript-execution-optimization\">性能优化(03) · 主线程 JS 执行优化</a> — 卸载与任务切片的配合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Worker 池：复用线程与负载均衡","id":"worker-池-复用线程与负载均衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"池大小：该开几根线程","id":"池大小-该开几根线程"},{"level":2,"text":"一个最小池实现","id":"一个最小池实现"},{"level":2,"text":"背压：队列积压时怎么办","id":"背压-队列积压时怎么办"},{"level":2,"text":"池的生命周期与清理","id":"池的生命周期与清理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"SharedArrayBuffer 与 Atomics：真正的共享内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/communication/shared-array-buffer"},"next":{"title":"RPC 与 Comlink：把 postMessage 写成本地调用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/patterns/comlink-rpc"}}